  "• <b>Research Use Only:</b> This application is developed strictly for research, self-exploration, and educational study. It is <b>not a medical device</b> and does not diagnose, treat, or prevent clinical psychological conditions.<br><br>• <b>Data Sovereignty:</b> Operates 100% local-first. All scores, responses, and session notes stay in your private browser sandbox (IndexedDB / localStorage) and are never automatically transmitted to any server.<br><br>• <b>User Portability:</b> You may download your entire dataset anytime in standardized JSON or CSV format, or permanently erase it with one click.": [
    "AboutView"
